<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Coelce posts Q1 net vs loss.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Coelce posts Q1 net vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian state electrical utility Coelce, owned by Ceara state, released the following first-quarter 1997 results, according to the Sao Paulo bolsa.</p>
<p>		    Q1 1997		  Q1 1996</p>
<p> Net profit   7.609 million	   loss 585,000</p>
<p> Net Revs   104.3 million	     84.5 million</p>
<p> Oper Profit 12.266 million	    2.114 million</p>
<p> Net Worth  414.2 million	    389.7 million</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in Brazilian reais, not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>((-- James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485413))</p>
</text>
